       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ORDER-TOTAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-SUBTOTAL PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-TAX      PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-TOTAL    PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-SUBTOTAL + WS-TAX
           IF WS-TOTAL > 9999999.99
              MOVE 9999999.99 TO WS-TOTAL
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
